Steps in natural language processing:

- Is it difficult to understand human language?
    Understanding human language is difficult, even for people who have grown up with it. Human language
    is incredibly complex, full of strange expressions that seem to contradict each other, metaphors
    that require cultural knowledge to understand, and grammatical structures that sometimes turn simple
    ideas into tongue-twisters. Machines require systems that research scientists call natural language
    processing, or NLP, to understand human language. IBM Project Debater was the most complex AI system
    IBM Research had ever built to understand human language.

